  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CAFOD Contribution to Support Costs and Nutritionist</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CAFOD has contributed financially to the ongoing project &quot;Rapid response targeting malnourished children and pregnant and lactating women EA17/2008&quot; (see Project HIB133). In the Emergency Appeal, there was no provision for a Nutritionist to support the operation technically. The implementing partner ECS has now recognised and accepted that such a technical support is necessary and a nutritionist has now been recruited. The purpose of the present project is to provide for the costs of the nutritionist (2 months support) as well as other costs related to the support provided by TROCAIRE and CAFOD with the temporary assignment in Ethiopia of Clody Wright (TROCAIRE) and Philippe Mougin (CAFOD HSD).  This project is therefore complementary and closely linked to the core EA 17/2008 intervention, with the same goal and objectives.</narrative>
  </description>
